[I] Japanese kana-kanji conversion engine

[T] Anthy Unicode is a Japanese kana-kanji conversion engine, a fork of the no
[T] longer maintained Anthy project, converted to use UTF-8 internally instead
[T] of EUC-JP and to store user files under XDG_CONFIG_HOME.

[U] https://github.com/fujiwarat/anthy-unicode

